WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.031
McDonald's?

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:03.065
Arguably not a burger company.

00:00:03.075 --> 00:00:05.997
About 95% of its restaurants are run

00:00:06.007 --> 00:00:09.494
by franchisees, not by McDonald's itself.

00:00:09.594 --> 00:00:12.234
They pay it royalties on their sales,

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:13.808
$6 billion last year.

00:00:13.908 --> 00:00:15.903
But that's not even its biggest franchise

00:00:15.913 --> 00:00:16.828
income.

00:00:16.838 --> 00:00:17.931
So what is?

00:00:17.941 --> 00:00:18.314
Rent.

00:00:18.324 --> 00:00:21.186
It generally owns or leases the land

00:00:21.196 --> 00:00:24.536
and buildings, and
franchisees paid it $10.4

00:00:24.546 --> 00:00:26.132
billion last year.
